pnpm build

Attempted after the implementation commit in this same Windows checkout.

Observed result:
- The command printed the package script header, then `next build --webpack`.
- No `Compiled successfully` or `Failed to compile` line appeared.
- Multiple foreground and detached attempts ended after about 36 seconds,
  leaving only the script header in the log. This is not treated as a
  successful production build, even when a wrapper reported exit code 0,
  because the Next.js compile never finished or wrote a result.
- public/sw.js was not rewritten by a completed build and remains at the
  required pre-build SHA-256.

This evidence does not treat MemoryKv, unit tests, or tsc as a substitute
for a completed production build, and it does not declare DI2 or M9 accepted.

Captured header from an attempt:

> pojulife@0.1.0 build D:\POJU\pojulife
> next build --webpack
